@startuml
title Energy-aware operation: sense, decide, act, place (ASUC-04)
autonumber
hide footbox
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow false
participant "Time Trigger" as P0 #edf1f5
participant "Carbon Monitor" as P1 #e3f6ed
participant "Energy Signal Provider" as P2 #edf1f5
participant "Policy Engine" as P3 #e3f6ed
participant "Data Store" as P4 #f3edff
participant "Event Bus" as P5 #edf1f5
participant "Job Scheduler" as P6 #fff3df
participant "Forecast Worker" as P7 #e3f6ed
participant "Placement Controller" as P8 #e3f6ed
participant "Kubernetes API" as P9 #edf1f5
P0 -> P1 : Refresh signals (every 5 minutes)
activate P1
P1 -> P2 : Read carbon intensity, price, renewable flag
P2 --> P1 : Values with timestamp / unavailable
P1 -> P1 : Validate range and freshness
P1 -> P4 : Save sample (or a MISSING sample)
deactivate P1
P0 -> P3 : Evaluate operating mode
activate P3
P3 -> P4 : Load active policy and current mode
P3 -> P1 : Read the two latest samples
alt no valid sample for longer than stale limit
P3 -> P3 : Mode GREEN, reason signal_stale (fail-safe)
else signal current
P3 -> P3 : Classify intensity and price with hysteresis; take the more restrictive class
P3 -> P3 : Renewable available forces GREEN; apply unexpired operator override
end
alt mode changed
P3 -> P4 : Persist new mode (source of truth)
P3 -> P5 : Publish mode.changed(from, to, reason)
end
deactivate P3
P5 -> P6 : Deliver modeChanged
P5 -> P8 : Deliver modeChanged
P0 -> P6 : Tick
activate P6
P6 -> P3 : Read current mode (pull, cached up to 60 s)
P6 -> P4 : Claim due jobs with lease
loop each claimed job
alt deadline reached or GREEN or (AMBER and half window left)
P6 -> P7 : Run forecast job
activate P7
P7 -> P4 : Read observations; store versioned forecast if sanity check passes
P7 --> P6 : Outcome and duration
deactivate P7
P6 -> P6 : Estimate kWh and gCO2e
else deferrable job
P6 -> P4 : Release lease; next check before deadline
end
P6 -> P4 : Write job execution log
end
deactivate P6
P8 -> P3 : Read mode and placement target
P8 -> P9 : Check node pools, taint non-target pool (NoExecute)
P9 --> P8 : Pods rescheduled on target pool
P8 -> P4 : Record placement decision (APPLIED / SKIPPED)
@enduml
